            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Twiddle 0.9.1

- Restores the illustrated drag-to-Applications installer window.
- Restarts audio capture if the output route changes or the Mac wakes during first-run setup.
- Adds capture activity to CLI status for troubleshooting silent audio.
- Restores update signing with a new key. If you installed 0.9 or earlier, download this version once from twiddle.fun; future updates can then install in the app.
]]></description>
